{% doc %}
  Every delivery sentence that depends on the VISITOR'S market, in one place
  (PRD R8, R11, decision 5f). Each surface asks for the shape it needs, so no
  section tests the country itself and none can tell a visitor abroad about UK
  delivery.

  - GB market: the UK promise ("Free UK delivery", true for every UK order).
  - Every other market: a neutral line that names the visitor's country and
    points at checkout, where the rate and the time for their address are shown.
    Nothing is promised that the theme cannot know. The duties sentence is the
    FAQ's own ("Do you deliver outside the UK?").

  The country is Shopify's market country (localization.country), the same one
  that decides the catalogue, the prices and the checkout. The store has no
  market web presences, so it changes only when the visitor changes country
  (snippets/country-selector.liquid, in the footer).
  The title and line of the pair live in Theme settings > Delivery; "[country]"
  in a setting is replaced by the country's name as it reads in a sentence
  ("the United States", "the Netherlands", "Germany").

  Shapes (format):
    pair           <strong>title</strong> <span>line</span>   announcement bar, trust strip
    title          the title as text                           footer chip
    stat           <strong>KEY</strong> rest                   home "what every order includes"
    checkout_note  a sentence about delivery cost              home "No surprises at checkout"
    drawer_nudge   the cart drawer's add-on prompt
    drawer_note    the cart drawer's delivery and tax line
    ship_note      the ghost preview's delivery note, PLAIN TEXT (the search
                   section puts it in an attribute and escapes it): the market's
                   Delivery setting line. It names no time: a supplier item has no
                   measured figure until it is imported, and its product page then
                   shows its own estimate. An overseas item's note replaces it
                   (assets/pawscout.js).
  @param {string} [format] - one of the shapes above; pair when omitted
  @param {boolean} [link] - pair only: the title links to the country selector
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign shape = format | default: 'pair'
  # Names that take "the" in a sentence, by ISO code. A new market whose name needs
  # the article is added here; every other name is used as Shopify gives it.
  assign article_codes = 'GB,US,NL,AE,PH' | split: ','
  assign country_name = localization.country.name
  if article_codes contains localization.country.iso_code
    assign country_name = 'the ' | append: country_name
  endif
  assign uk = false
  if localization.country.iso_code == 'GB'
    assign uk = true
  endif
  if uk
    assign promise_title = settings.delivery_promise_title_uk | default: 'Free UK delivery'
    assign promise_text = settings.delivery_promise_text_uk | default: 'On every order, no minimum'
  else
    assign promise_title = settings.delivery_promise_title_other | default: 'Delivery to [country]'
    assign promise_text = settings.delivery_promise_text_other | default: 'Rates and times at checkout'
  endif
  assign promise_title = promise_title | replace: '[country]', country_name
  assign promise_text = promise_text | replace: '[country]', country_name
-%}
{%- case shape -%}
  {%- when 'title' -%}
    {{- promise_title | escape -}}
  {%- when 'stat' -%}
    {%- if uk -%}
      <strong>FREE</strong> UK delivery on every order
    {%- else -%}
      <strong>Delivery</strong> to {{ country_name | escape }}, priced at checkout
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'checkout_note' -%}
    {%- if uk -%}
      UK delivery is free on every order with no minimum. Shipping and taxes are shown at checkout before you pay.
    {%- else -%}
      The delivery rate for {{ country_name | escape }} is shown at checkout before you pay. Local import duties or taxes set by the destination country may apply and are not included in our prices.
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'drawer_nudge' -%}
    {%- if uk -%}
      UK delivery is <strong>FREE</strong> - complete the kit:
    {%- else -%}
      Complete the kit:
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'drawer_note' -%}
    {%- if uk -%}
      Free UK delivery &middot; taxes calculated at checkout.
    {%- else -%}
      Delivery to {{ country_name | escape }} and taxes calculated at checkout.
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'ship_note' -%}
    {%- if uk -%}
      {%- assign detail = settings.delivery_detail_uk | default: 'Free UK delivery on every order. Tracking details are sent after dispatch.' -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign detail = settings.delivery_detail_other | default: 'Delivery options and times are shown at checkout.' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    Ships from our supplier network. {{ detail }}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- if link -%}
      <strong data-delivery-promise><a href="#CountrySelector" data-country-jump title="Change delivery country">{{ promise_title | escape }}</a></strong>
    {%- else -%}
      <strong data-delivery-promise>{{ promise_title | escape }}</strong>
    {%- endif %}
    <span data-delivery-promise-line>{{ promise_text | escape }}</span>
{%- endcase -%}
